  "notes": "{引|ひ}く is a versatile godan verb with multiple meanings related to pulling, drawing, and subtracting.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: none (but contrast with ⟦{押|お}す→押す：02854_osu⟧ 'to push')\n\nMEANING 1 - PULL/DRAW:\n- ⟦ドア→ドア：00773_doa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引|ひ}く: to pull the door\n- ⟦{線|せん}→線：09901_sen⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引|ひ}く: to draw a line\n- ⟦{辞書|じしょ}→辞書：04707_jisho⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引|ひ}く: to look up in a dictionary\n- ⟦{注意|ちゅうい}→注意：01464_chuui⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引|ひ}く: to draw attention\n\nMEANING 2 - SUBTRACT:\n- 5⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧3⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引|ひ}く: to subtract 3 from 5\n- ⟦{税|ぜい}→税：03767_zei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引|ひ}く: to deduct tax\n\nMEANING 3 - CATCH (COLD):\n- ⟦{風邪|かぜ}→風邪：02188_kaze⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引|ひ}く: to catch a cold\n\nNOTE: Different kanji exist: ⟦{弾|ひ}く→弾く：02444_hiku⟧ (play instrument), ⟦{轢|ひ}く→轢く：27775_hiku⟧ (run over).",
